    "body": "Also experiencing this problem, right-aligning the same items works fine and also deletes the space at the end of the prompt, but I wanted a 2 line prompt so the only way is to use fill.  Doesn't happen in the Windows Terminal though, only native Linux terminals.\r\n\r\nTop is windows terminal (working correctly), bottom is alacritty in arch linux.  All terminals I have work the same in linux as far as the space.\r\n\r\n![columnss](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/63003083/215919788-dab06f51-4306-4129-a2be-055c5cde4853.png)\r\n\r\n",
