    "updated_at": "2023-02-01T14:58:26Z",
    "body": "> This looks like it might be a character width issue, either caused by your terminal emulator's character-width handling, or the handling done by Fish.\r\n> \r\n> Can you try seeing if the issue still occurs after you've stripped multi-width characters like emoji and NerdFont icons from the row?\r\n\r\nYea good call on bash vs fish, seems to be a fish problem.\r\nTop is bash, bottom is Fish.  Still weird fish in the Windows Terminal on WSL works fine though.\r\n\r\n![bashvsfish](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/63003083/216058139-def3db59-33e4-4930-b7a7-b2385595dd78.png)\r\n\r\nEDIT:\r\n\r\nNot sure if this adds any extra context or helps anyone but using fish_right_prompt seems to work ok when not using Starship.\r\n\r\n![normalfish](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/63003083/216064713-ceafc9e3-db46-41ab-a3eb-a0e052b1a411.png)\r\n\r\nFound a few issues in the fish project relating to this but no real fixes:\r\nhttps://github.com/fish-shell/fish-shell/issues/8002\r\nhttps://github.com/fish-shell/fish-shell/issues/8164\r\nhttps://github.com/fish-shell/fish-shell/issues/8163\r\n",
